          </p>
          <dl class="mt-5 grid gap-3 border-t border-border pt-4 text-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Owner</dt>
              <dd class="font-semibold">Scheduling service</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Saved in</dt>
              <dd><code class="font-semibold">booking-policy.md</code></dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </article>

        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-center text-muted-foreground"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <ArrowRight class="hidden size-5 lg:block" />
          <ArrowDown class="size-5 lg:hidden" />
        </div>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-raised sm:p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <p class="eyebrow">Later session</p>
            <span class="inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-muted">
              <GitBranch
                class="size-4"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
            </span>
          </div>
          <ol
            class="mt-5 grid gap-4"
            aria-label="Later booking conversation"
          >
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span
                class="dark-surface-selection inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <UserRound
                  class="size-3.5"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                />
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground">You</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 font-semibold">
                  Add rescheduling to the booking assistant.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-border pt-4">
              <span
                class="inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-secondary"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <img
                  src={skillMarkPath}
                  width="207"
                  height="215"
                  alt=""
                  class="h-4 w-auto dark:invert"
                />
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground">Coding agent</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 font-semibold">
                  I’ll reuse live availability and preserve staff approval for same-day changes.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <p
            class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-border pt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200"
          >
            <Check
              class="size-4 shrink-0"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />Project memory, available when the next task needs it.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5">
        <ActionLink
          class="font-bold"
          href={withBase('/docs/how-it-works/', basePath)}
          variant="link"
